    },
    {
      "id": "bridge_damage",
      "scene": "crossroads",
      "min_seconds": 2.2,
      "camera": {
        "from": [432, 1203],
        "to": [432, 1203]
      },
      "actors": [],
      "sound": "riverbank",
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "speaker": "local",
          "text": "*quietly* I saw the flash from the fields. By the time I reached the bank, the middle of the bridge was gone."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "local",
          "text": "It had split the road on both sides. Stone all over the water."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "relief",
      "scene": "crossroads",
      "min_seconds": 1.0,
      "camera": {
        "from": [3734, 623],
        "to": [3734, 623]
      },
      "actors": [
        {"id": "aldric", "pose": "gesture_left", "position": [4004, 863]},
        {"id": "local", "pose": "stand_right", "position": [3899, 863]},
        {"id": "clerk", "pose": "read_left", "position": [4064, 879]},
        {"id": "caravan", "pose": "parked_left", "position": [4334, 888]}
      ],
      "sound": "roadside",
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "speaker": "aldric",
          "text": "We've seen damage like this elsewhere. I wish I could tell you why."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "local",
          "text": "Elsewhere? I thought we had been unlucky."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "aldric",
          "text": "So did the people I visited before coming here. There have been a few such incidents."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "local",
          "text": "And every place needs the same stone and carts."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "aldric",
          "text": "*nods* Yes. That's part of what I've come to discuss."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "aldric",
          "text": "Tell my clerk which deliveries are waiting. The crew needs to know what people are still trying to get through."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "clerk",
          "text": "I can take that down now."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "local",
          "text": "Thank you. I know ours isn't the only road."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "aldric",
          "text": "It's still the one you need. Thank you for stopping me."
        }
      ]
    },
