        {
          "speaker": "serene",
          "text": "I wish I had a simpler answer for him.",
          "thought": true
        },
        {
          "speaker": "tomas",
          "text": "Mother? Are these enough cups?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "serene",
          "text": "*turns back to him* Bring two more, love."
        },
